From: Kreijstal <rainb@tfwno.gf>
Subject: [PATCH] vkd3d-shader/hlsl: Mark comparison samplers in the RDEF.

fxc sets D3D_SIF_COMPARISON_SAMPLER in the bound-resource flags of a
SamplerComparisonState, which D3DReflect() reports in
D3D11_SHADER_INPUT_BIND_DESC.uFlags.
---
--- a/libs/vkd3d-shader/hlsl_codegen.c
+++ b/libs/vkd3d-shader/hlsl_codegen.c
@@ -15294,6 +15294,9 @@
 
         if (resource->is_user_packed)
             flags |= D3D_SIF_USERPACKED;
+        if (resource->regset == HLSL_REGSET_SAMPLERS
+                && resource->component_type->sampler_dim == HLSL_SAMPLER_DIM_COMPARISON)
+            flags |= D3D_SIF_COMPARISON_SAMPLER;
 
         put_u32(buffer, 0); /* name */
         if (resource->buffer)
